From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rhys Perry <pendingchaos02@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:12:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] radv: stop checking dirty bit in CmdExecuteCommands HiZ
 workaround

If a secondary command buffer has image views, but is followed by a
CmdExecuteCommands with a secondary command buffer which does not, we
should disable HiZ.

17bbd45d59d probably fixed this, but 6b3223895f9 would have broken it
again.

Signed-off-by: Rhys Perry <pendingchaos02@gmail.com>
Fixes: 6b3223895f9 ("radv: invalidate command buffer state after executing secondaries")
Reviewed-by: Samuel Pitoiset <samuel.pitoiset@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit c21591317be944be5c641ccd87d6219cd9a93040)

Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/45704>
(cherry picked from commit 21b7a8c08f037fe018491ca3627514988382e78f)
---
 src/amd/vulkan/radv_cmd_buffer.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_cmd_buffer.c b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_cmd_buffer.c
index 2b8fa0c96b1..a3d615250a2 100644
--- a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_cmd_buffer.c
+++ b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_cmd_buffer.c
@@ -10171,7 +10171,7 @@ radv_CmdExecuteCommands(VkCommandBuffer commandBuffer, uint32_t commandBufferCou
       radv_merge_queue_state(&secondary->queue_state, &primary->queue_state);
 
       if (!secondary->state.render.has_image_views) {
-         if (primary->state.render.active && (primary->state.dirty & RADV_CMD_DIRTY_GFX12_HIZ_WA_STATE)) {
+         if (primary->state.render.active) {
             if (pdev->gfx12_hiz_wa == RADV_GFX12_HIZ_WA_FULL) {
                const struct radv_rendering_state *render = &primary->state.render;
                const struct radv_image_view *iview = render->ds_att.iview;
-- 
